      "probe_comment_url": "https://github.com/squne121/agent-platform/issues/67#issuecomment-6593640566",
      "summary": "GitHub rewrites control characters to caret notation on persist: U+0001,0002,0007,000E,001B,001F and U+0080,0085,009B,009F were changed (e.g. BEL -> ^G, ESC -> ^[ ); tab, LF, VT, FF, CR, BS, DEL, NBSP, U+2028/2029, ZWSP, BOM, emoji, CJK, backslashes, quotes, Markdown and shell metacharacters round-trip unchanged. The production verifier fails closed (binding_body_hash_mismatch) on the changed text.",
      "mitigation": "snapshot body values pass through json.dumps (escapes C0); _json_compact additionally escapes DEL/C1 so no rewritten character can be emitted raw."
    }
